    excerpt: 'An Ypsilanti Township pet shop owner accused failing to properly take care of the animals in his shop, selling sick and dying animals, has been sentenced to probation.',
  },
  {
    source: 'mLive',
    title: 'Probation, apology letter ordered from man who stole from girls soccer team',
    img: 'https://pagesmith-cdn.com/ee60f2da/images/1-dbbd85-200.webp',
